.task
bin
frontend/dist
frontend/node_modules
build/linux/appimage/build
build/windows/nsis/MicrosoftEdgeWebview2Setup.exe
.idea/

# Generated Wails bindings: regenerated by `wails3 generate bindings`
frontend/bindings/github.com/wailsapp

# The key releases are signed with. Its public half is tracked and compiled
# into every binary this repository ships (updates.go); the private half signs
# the manifest in CI and lives in the secret store, never here.
updater.key
**/updater.key

# What a release is built into on the way to the bucket.
dist

# libghostty-vt and the Ghostty source it is built from (wails3 task common:ghostty:lib).
build/ghostty
